# Floor invariant 9 of 16 (spec/floor-v2.md §4). Layer: floor.
# Statement tightens the floor prose: "the rubric (§5)" dropped the spec-internal
# section pointer, leaving "Extract when the rubric passes".
"@context": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/context/v1"
"@id": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/vertex/invariant-09-public-first"
"@type": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/ontology/Invariant"
label: "Public-first"
layer: "floor"
statement: >
  Public-first. Before building inside, ask why this cannot be a public crate or
  repo; work backwards from that. Extract when the rubric passes; private only
  for named domain knowledge or secrets.
